From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] uiautomationcore: default non-client provider (3581)

uiautomationcore: default non-client provider, UiaProviderForNonClient

The default ProviderType_NonClientArea provider (was a FIXME returning nothing) and the exported
UiaProviderForNonClient: the window's OBJID_WINDOW (or a given OBJID_*/child) IAccessible wrapped by the
MSAA provider, flagged ClientSide|NonClientArea, so nodes for HWNDs get a "Nonclient" provider between
Main and Hwnd. The OBJID_WINDOW root has no parent (the Hwnd provider stays the parent link) and no
UseComThreading (a node can be made with COM uninitialized). Nonclient provider checks in the test
are no longer todo.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XZFS4SPPzeH5d2c1MuzqCS
---
